$ moolah init --base ILS --no-backup-key
Book "main" is ready in $TMP/data/books/main.db (base currency ILS).
Next: add your accounts, for example:
  moolah account add Checking --kind bank --currency ILS --opening 1000
  moolah category list

$ moolah account add leumi --kind bank --currency ILS --opening 25000 --date 2026-10-01
Added account leumi (ILS).

$ moolah account add chase --kind card --currency USD
Added account chase (USD).

$ moolah account add harel --kind pension --currency ILS --opening 380000 --date 2026-10-01
Added account harel (ILS).

$ moolah add leumi -200 food --date 2026-10-03 --payee Shufersal --note weekly --tag trip
Added transaction 3 on 2026-10-03 (Shufersal):
  assets:bank:leumi              -200.00 ILS
  expenses:food                  200.00 ILS

$ moolah transfer leumi chase 1530 --to-amount 420 --fee 15 --date 2026-11-01
Added transaction 4 on 2026-11-01 (Transfer):
  assets:bank:leumi              -1,545.00 ILS
  liabilities:card:chase         420.00 USD (for 1,530.00 ILS)
  expenses:fees                  15.00 ILS

$ moolah add chase -42.17 shopping --date 2026-11-02 --payee Amazon
Added transaction 5 on 2026-11-02 (Amazon):
  liabilities:card:chase         -42.17 USD
  expenses:shopping              42.17 USD

$ moolah value harel 390000 --date 2026-10-31
Booked a gain of 10,000.00 ILS (balance was 380,000.00 ILS). Transaction 6.

$ moolah rates add 2026-10-31 USD ILS 3.65
Saved 1 USD = 3.65 ILS on 2026-10-31.

$ moolah rule add amazon shopping
Added rule 1.

$ moolah export $TMP/export
Exported 6 transactions to $TMP/export:
  moolah.journal
  transactions.csv
  prices.csv
  rules.csv
  settings.toml
The files are not encrypted. Keep them somewhere safe, or delete them when done.

$ moolah export $TMP/export
error: $TMP/export is not empty. Export into a new folder, so no file is overwritten
[exit 1]


